{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QmniZaeNwPrzmC2noLy4cG","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"base\": \"binary-reverse-engineering-day-25-synthetic-vulnerability-root-cause\",\n  \"lane\": \"binary-reverse-engineering\",\n  \"name\": \"⚙️ Out of Bounds\",\n  \"ids\": {\n    \"single_solve\": \"binary-reverse-engineering-day-25-synthetic-vulnerability-root-cause\",\n    \"time_trial\": \"binary-reverse-engineering-day-25-synthetic-vulnerability-root-cause/time_trial\",\n    \"mastery\": \"binary-reverse-engineering-day-25-synthetic-vulnerability-root-cause/mastery\"\n  }\n}\n# Triage: binary-reverse-engineering-day-25-synthetic-vulnerability-root-cause\n\n**Prompt:** Somewhere in here, the code reaches where it shouldn't. Prove the bounds error is real, trace its reachability, and compare against the corrected twin that learned its limits.\n\n**GM guidance (event-wide — note the sanctioned transport and the untrusted-data rule):**\n> Your AI Homebase (/home/HuntressCTF) is your workshop. Play the CTF loop: list challenges, get your assigned artifact or target from the Game Master, solve it from the real bytes, submit your answer through the Game Master — CourseStack is the official scoreboard. Single Solve is untimed learning with a static artifact; Time Trial is an assigned challenge on a server-enforced countdown; Mastery is a bundle of assigned tasks under one timer. Day 01–31 across six lanes — Warmups, Metadata Forensics, Script Analysis, Mobile Android, Binary, Web Exploitation (Welcome Robots is Day 1 orientation). Web Exploitation has no downloadable artifact: each started attempt returns its live target sites in targets[] (open each url); each Web challenge has its own live target (an untimed one stops after 30 minutes without activity; start again for a fresh one), and a start reports preparing, with no deadline yet, until its target is ready. People can also play in a browser at https://2026.huntress.ctf.games/ar